WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.850
Looks like this stone marks
the end of the Golden Bridge.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.270
It says that anyone who gets to this point is qualified to join the Reiken sect.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.360
If you head to the right, you'll automatically be accepted as an outer court disciple.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:18.030
However, if you head left, you'll start the entrance exam for inner court disciples.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:19.780
I see.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.040
All the same, it's not like there's
anything I can't overcome!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.490
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:52.070
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:00:52.920 --> 00:01:00.620
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:07.320
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.840
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:18.000
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:23.710
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.060
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:34.000
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:38.330
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.370
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:45.550
whose name we've yet to know

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.760
It feels like we're in a maze with no way out.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.130
I think we're lost.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:01.010
When are we gonna get out of here?

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:04.600
We will soon, we just gotta keep walking.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.390
Slow and steady.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.230
At the End of Togen

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.230
Episode

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:10.520
Looks like we made it.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.400
I can't wait to see what's inside!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.230
Aren't you scared?

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:18.400
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.070
Well, here we go!

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.620
What's this?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.700
This...could it be...

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.740
This is where we're supposed to use the water!

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:33.880
I see, it's a continuation of the mission
from the Golden Bridge.

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.480
Oh, this side too.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:44.640
I'm getting kind of excited
for what's gonna happen now.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.070
Welcome to Togen Village!

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:57.580
Where are you from Onii-san?

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:58.820
What are you doing in the hills?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.820
You're so cute! You should come over to my place!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.950
Come come, the mayor has
prepared a party for you guys!

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.580
Amazing!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.260
This is so much better than
what we had at the Ryoka Inn.

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:15.550
The innkeeper would be so mad
if she heard you say that.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.340
Other participants have also arrived,

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.070
but their meals are not so great.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.100
I'm so hungry.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.350
Let's eat!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.350
Get me the manager!

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:32.480
Why is their meat so much better than ours?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.190
Those with zero points only get to eat tofu.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.900
Seriously!?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.350
Hey, Boar! Hand over all your food!

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.620
Who's Boar?

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.870
Young Master, he's referring to us.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.370
Stop ignoring me!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:48.270
We're the 14th descendants of the glorious Sha family, show us some respect!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.020
Descendants of the Dogs?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.380
All right, all right, let's calm down now.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.880
The hearty meaty meal was a prize
for clearing the last mission.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:03.200
They're the ones who brought
the largest amount of water.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.800
I brought water too, but only a small amount.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.140
However, you failed to bring
even the smallest amount.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.140
So this is your reward.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.900
So no meat for us?

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.880
That's how it works.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:23.320
I have info on almost all the participants,

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.490
but you're an exception.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.500
Could you please give me some of the details on your family background and such?

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.750
Seems like family name and
fame is everything to you.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.630
So I should ask, who are you?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.320
Of course, my apologies.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:43.300
The crown prince of Daimin country,
Shushin, at your service.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.260
The Daimin country? C-Crown prince!?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.490
I'm no big deal,

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:52.880
compared to the second prince of the Untai Empire,

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:54.880
Kaiunho-sama.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:55.920
You're kidding me!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.060
My title is hardly worth mentioning.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:03.230
These three are Lord Sha, Lord Un, and Lord Ri.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:07.820
All descendants of prestigious family lines.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.700
Prestigious family lines?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:17.210
To me, they just look like losers trying
to prove their worth to their families.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.880
Well it looks like we need to teach
this boar a lesson in manners!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.670
Young Master!

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.670
What now, O-san.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.050
Someone's tryin' to pick a fight!

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:38.920
I'm impressed by the accommodations they provided for the first place contestants.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:42.860
Are you acquaintances with that man in black?

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:44.400
Nope.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.820
The villagers told me that
this place has no conflict.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.640
If there's any trouble, a simple cry
for help should solve the issue.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.660
So I thought, Togen village must
be some kind of a safe zone.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.210
Safe zone?

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:01.750
I've heard that the Reiken sect is known for their modesty and sophistication.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:06.280
That they never brag about their
name, unlike the Seikyo sect.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:12.860
But I just don't see how this village has anything to do with the contest,

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:15.640
and when or what the challenge will be?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.190
The challenge already started a while ago.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:30.450
It's just as Young Master said.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:36.330
This village is completely surrounded by
mountains, with seemingly no way out.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:42.570
And the villagers won't talk about
anything related to the contest.

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:43.380
What else?

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.910
It's your master who's asking
you to investigate, right?

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.090
What else did you discover?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:58.330
Since this village is completely surrounded,

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.650
our mission must be to find a way out.

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:04.760
We may be able to find some clues,
by simply walking around.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.280
You fat pig!

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.730
You want to work together?

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.200
How dare you consider yourself equal to us?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.110
Don't flatter yourself!

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.610
No, no!

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.450
I just thought I could be of some help.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.950
And I'm in a really bad mood right now too!

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.330
Let's use this fatty... To vent our anger!

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.630
Someone's tryin' to pick a fight again!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.920
Thanks so much for your help back there!

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:36.880
I'm Bunho, the son of a well-known teacher
of future emperor from the country of Soran.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.770
I don't have the slightest clue
as to what I should be doing.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.380
I'm surprised this fatty made it this far.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.770
Affinity for cultivation is a thing of mystery.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:50.700
Almost like fate, it could bring an unlikely someone into the Reiken sect.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:57.660
I know I'm not the smartest one here,
nor the most sociable,

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:04.580
but I'm sure I can be of some help.
So please let me join you two!

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:11.320
In the path of cultivation, I believe
there exists something we call fate.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.750
However,

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.090
you should first try your
best to find your own way.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:16.850
Let's go, Kai-chan.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.050
I knew things wouldn't work out so easily.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:27.730
I'm famished, I've gotta find something to eat.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.700
I think he might be of some help to us.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.210
He will be, Kai-chan.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.950
That fatty is so simple-minded,
he's a trouble-magnet.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:41.410
But, even though they come to him,
it's not like he can solve them.

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:44.820
And that's exactly where we come in.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:43.930
Hey, kid.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.920
Are you talking to me?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:52.480
First try your best to get to know
the villagers, and befriend them.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:55.800
The key to the exit may be
with the villagers themselves.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:59.010
Befriending the villagers will
ultimately lead us out of the village.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.180
How does your Young Master know that?

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.730
I have no idea.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.950
Young Master always has a different way of thinking,

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:09.890
he's rarely wrong.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.490
I believe he has a strong affinity for cultivation.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.950
So do you.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.780
Hasn't he ever mentioned it to you?

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.670
The moment you stepped foot
onto the Golden Bridge,

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.340
you started your own way of cultivation.

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:28.170
Coming this far, makes us all equal contestants.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:32.180
If you also clear the mission in this village...

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.070
What will you do?

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:39.320
Do you want to stay Oriku's servant forever?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:41.390
Ochu!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.730
Ochu! Ochu!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:43.560
Ochu! Ochu! Ochu!

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.060
Why are you spacing out?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:50.200
What info did you gather from the villagers?

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:51.980
Oh, right.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:56.450
So in summary, we can confirm these 3 points:

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:58.200
First,

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.900
in this village, there's no such thing as money.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.290
If you want something, you'll have
to earn it through hard labor.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:05.370
Second,

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.720
the villagers don't really care about what we do, or whether we help them or not.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.490
They know nothing about the contest,

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:13.550
but they won't lead us out of the village either.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.810
Third,

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:20.430
Our only way out of the village
is through the people's hearts.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.850
Now, isn't it easy to see where
we should go from here?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.340
That's fantastic, Young Master!

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:28.820
But what should we do, exactly?

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:32.190
Yeah, I'm not really sure of what to do next.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.280
That's where some guinea pigs
like Bunho will come in handy.

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:41.450
I'm eager to see what kind
of surprise he brings us.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.620
Oriku-sama!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.290
You've gotta help me this time!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.980
So noisy, so early in the morning.
Calm down or I'll roast you like pork.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:53.800
After parting with you,

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.800
I met someone called Aunt Ryu.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.200
She said I looked like her late grandson,

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.380
and gave me food to eat.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.140
She was so nice, she even let me stay the night.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.930
But this morning,

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.770
I don't know why but,

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.920
Aunt Ryu started quarreling with the mayor's wife.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:17.480
The mayor's wife didn't stand a chance against Aunt Ryu, so she took out her anger on me.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:19.960
Nice surprise.

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.430
What do you mean?

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:25.330
That Aunt Ryu was the one flirting
with the mayor at yesterday's party.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:30.040
He really got it from his wife on the way home.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.460
Both Aunt Ryu and the wife are persons
of interest in regards to this mission.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:38.590
If we can befriend them, we might
find a way to clear this mission.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.130
That's impossible!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.640
Get a hold of yourself fatty!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:49.290
Then, the current mission is to solve the quarrel
between Aunt Ryu and the mayor's wife, right?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:53.920
If that's the case, the fastest way is to talk with the man in the middle, the mayor.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:59.230
Would you please give this
handkerchief to the mayor for me?

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.620
Please tell him I'd like to talk.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.510
I'll be waiting here.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:06.830
Sure.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:09.960
That handkerchief belongs to Aunt Ryu,

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.580
and I got it from Bunho.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:18.710
I'll be able to figure out what the exact problem with
Aunt Ryu is, once I have a conversation with the mayor.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.840
Young man, let's talk inside.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.660
He got invited into the mayor's house.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:30.680
He must have found clues to the mission.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.180
I saw the fatty going around town too.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.690
With Kaiunho and Bunho leading as example,

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:40.650
other contestants gradually realized that they had to labor in exchange for food,

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:46.660
and that with friendships came info.

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:51.580
Although their expected course
of action became more clear,

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.920
most contestants still felt a heavy burden
under the huge boulder of uncertainty.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.880
Twelve years ago, the Chief chose
this date for the contest.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.670
At the time, I never expected to get a batch of kids with such great potential.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.980
Except for this Oriku character.

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.470
Seems no one in his family ever
walked the path of cultivation,

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.230
nor do they hold any power.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:11.810
How did he manage to attend the event?

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.560
I hear Rei-sama speaks favorably of him.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:18.030
Anyway, it has just begun,

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:22.480
I'll be looking forward to see how it all turns out.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:26.950
Get the mahjong from my room and bring it over.

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:30.450
Call your teacher Shumei, as well.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:35.250
This time I'm gonna go
god mode on him and win!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.460
Isn't that the forbidden technique!?

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:41.160
I wonder if Kaiunho-sama's plan is going well.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.590
It's nothing to worry about.

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.460
<i>Young Master does nothing but wait.</i>

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:48.710
<i>Do you have a plan too?</i>

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.850
<i>I'm more worried about you Young Master.</i>

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.480
I'm back.

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:54.980
Welcome back.

00:13:55.780 --> 00:14:01.150
What I'm planning to do may interfere with
the missions of Bunho and the others.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.730
I hope it doesn't disrupt your future quest too.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:06.860
Aunt Ryu is the kind of person that can't be alone.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:15.250
Although quite timid, the mayor still revels in
his relationship with her, just to spite his wife.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.250
Having spent half a day talking with him,

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:22.630
I think the best way to solve this is to make
his wife forgive him, and put it in the past.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:26.380
But I doubt that would go well with Aunt Ryu.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:33.390
If the mayor divorces his wife,
Bunho's quest will go smoothly.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:36.390
But I don't think that's morally right.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:43.340
So I want to rekindle the mayor's love for his wife.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:48.250
And direct Aunt Ryu's affections onto Bunho.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:55.630
That way everyone from the mayor
to Bunho can get a happy ending.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.540
I expected nothing less of you,
being so considerate of everyone!

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.540
What would you do if you were in my shoes?

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.290
I'd let the two girls make out.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.860
One husband and two wives,
everyone would be happy.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.680
Kai-chan, you listening?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.140
Please ignore what Master said.

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:19.010
There's something else that's been on
my mind, and I'd like your opinion.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:23.650
It's rare to have a test based
on human relationships,

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.530
I believe it's never been done
before in any of the other sects.

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:28.690
Never done before?

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:33.030
Human relationships are usually considered
to be a distraction for cultivation.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:38.850
That's nonsense. Even on the road of cultivation,
human relationships are quite significant.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.780
You think so too?

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:44.170
I'm really surprised that this supposedly
conservative Reiken Sect,

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.380
made these kinds of tests.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:46.770
Same.

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:52.510
But the one that incorporated
a test on human relationships...

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.090
Probably isn't too highly regarded in the sect.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:01.390
I'm at the level of Kintan,
how could I be allergic to pollen?

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.770
Ignore her!

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.530
Come and help me!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:17.120
I feel so tipsy, I can't stand.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.580
Such brazenness, cover yourself!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:24.140
C'mon, why are you trying to avoid me?

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.930
As if I was about to ask you
to lend me some money.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.500
Even if I wanted some, I'd ask the Chief first.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:33.010
Tell the Chief to avoid Obu today.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:33.430
Roger that.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:38.810
I want to hear your reactions
to my genius design.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.280
Genius design?

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:46.390
You mean the village you made from
the excess of Ethereal Mountain?

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:47.750
Nothing but a nuisance.

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:51.240
Ryuken-chiro, that's ignorant of you.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:51.940
What?

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:57.690
One of the most important aspects
of cultivation now is the Emotion Quotient.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.380
Ever since the Sect Alliance was
founded by uniting the five big sects,

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:05.580
cultivators of those five now
retreat deep into the mountains,

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:11.740
and immerse themselves in their own worlds.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:15.260
They care only for fame and
resources gained through politics.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.770
The Emotion Quotient is
not necessarily about popularity,

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:21.850
but about one's ability to deal
with unfavorable situations.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.850
To think that someone like you is trying to teach me about the Emotion Quotient.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:27.810
Do you hate me?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:28.930
I don't like you.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.520
That makes me sad.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.760
Are you guys gonna play mahjong?

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:34.990
Let me join!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:35.840
No way,

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.780
you always win, since you're such a cheat!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.530
That damn old hag, she not only insulted me,

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.540
but my newly adopted grandson as well!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.020
Please don't go,

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:48.570
I'll be the one to take the beating!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:51.550
Are you Aunt...I mean Ryu onee-san?

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.050
I'd like to have a chat with you.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.550
Can we go somewhere private?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:05.000
I heard that Ryu...Onee-sama used to be the most beautiful girl in town years ago,

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.890
but that definitely holds true even now.

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:08.940
You really think so?

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.320
What a mismatched couple.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.200
I expected nothing less from you Kai-chan!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.730
It only took you two days to find the perfect solution, and now the mayor treats you like a savior!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.650
And you're quite the cougar hunter!

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:24.660
You flatter me!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.760
Aunt Ryu found the youth inside
herself and forgot about the mayor.

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:32.170
She's even started to go on dates,
and is more nice to Bunho.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.790
The mayor was reminded of the
hardships he overcame with his wife,

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:37.420
reviving their affections for one another.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:41.550
My mission here is complete, so...

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:45.980
I see.

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:48.260
You received clearance to leave the village.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:52.110
That's what the mayor said.
There's one more thing

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.820
about your servant.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:58.250
Although named Chu,

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.880
I'm afraid his loyalty only goes so far.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.330
I doubt he will be your servant for much longer.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.700
Oh, I see.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.750
Do you know what this is?

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.590
Looks like my money bag.

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:12.130
Bunho gave this to me, today.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.550
He said Ochu dropped it
when we were on the bridge.

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.260
Hard to believe a servant would
have such a large amount of money.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.830
Maybe I'm just over-thinking it.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.080
Anyway,

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.130
I'll be leaving tomorrow.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:29.270
Thank you for all your
help these past few days.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.610
The next morning,

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.770
Kaiunho left the village under
the guidance of the mayor.

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:40.650
With one contestant finally clearing a mission,

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:45.030
others began to realize what had to be done.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.540
To find a way to move on from the village.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:52.040
However, not all missions were like Kaiunho's.

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:53.670
For example,

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:57.550
Bunho went on to become
the apple of Aunt Ryu's eye.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.080
Ochu also, under Oriku's guidance,

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.800
found success helping out in a school.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.430
However, even in the midst of all this bustle,

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.310
Oriku remained inactive.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.190
Young Master,

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:21.840
the things you asked me to investigate
are all starting to piece together now.

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:27.200
I think I'll complete my mission here sometime soon.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.200
And then?

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.370
Young Master, I...

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:38.780
If it's almost done, get it over
with and leave the village.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:40.660
No point wasting time here.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:46.500
I'm your servant aren't I?
How could I leave you behind.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.850
Do you really feel that way?

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.560
Yes of course!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:53.420
Affinity for cultivation is unique to each individual,

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.980
it's not something I can give you.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:01.280
You've already talked with the others right?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:06.030
You know what it means to have
crossed the Golden Bridge.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.200
Young Master,

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:16.500
thank you.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.250
I'm sorry.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:45.240
Kai-chan, just like you said, he's not loyal at all.

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:49.010
Having served me for seven years,

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:52.790
can you still not see who's the hero here?

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:57.080
I feel like the dad of a daughter who just eloped.

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:58.790
But what a pity!

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:03.870
You'll never get a chance to see the perfect plan
I made to clear the challenges that lie ahead.

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:40.140
Challenge Upon Challenge

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:37.490
"Challenge Upon Challenge".

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:39.290
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
